  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> where the function <math><mi>f</mi></math> satisfies <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced></math> for all natural numbers <math><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math> Then the natural number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>'</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>'</mi></math> is:"
  },
