  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Put <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now, put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now, put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p>Similarly, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>10</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>k</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>k</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>10</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Using the sum of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;terms of a geometric progression, i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p>Also, we know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
